EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Your request to switch your major has been received; however, we are unable to complete the change because you are already enrolled in classes for your current major.

To finalize your change of majors, please contact your academic advisor. You can find your advisor in the advising directory at https://students.asu.edu/advising/directory.

If you have any questions, feel free to contact me at {!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}. I am your personal contact for admission-related questions, and I’ll be happy to help you through the admission process.

Sincerely,

{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Full_Name__c}
{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}
{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Pone__c}


If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
